   <description>
    <narrative xml:lang="EN">In 2023, we made an anchor investment of $15 million into Equator Africa Fund, as part of the fund&#xfffd;s first close. Of this total commitment, $5 million comes from our Climate Innovation Facility, with the aim to overcome barriers to investment and mobilise commercial capital. Our investment aims to solve key development challenges by supporting innovative, tech-enabled climate solutions across sub-Saharan Africa. The fund&apos;s investments are expected to span the sectors of e-mobility, energy efficiency and storage, water, climate analytics and agriculture.</narrative>
